      "design_implication": "When designing agentic tools, handoff often breaks because custom agent instructions remain locked inside single-app chat histories. By structuring agent workflows into reusable files that sit alongside code repositories, teams can standardize how assistants interpret tasks across different environments. Start by extracting common design system prompt fragments into dedicated repository files so every coding agent references identical component rules.",
