      "summary": "OpenAI launched ChatGPT Wallet, allowing its Dots AI agents to make purchases and check out automatically. The feature is rolling out for ChatGPT Pro subscribers in the US aged 18 and older using an eligible billing address and supported American Express, Chase, Mastercard, and Visa cards.",
